tsk_hld_cnd (Task hold conditions, ULONG)
  This is bit data. Each bit indicates why the execution of the task is 
  held. More than one bit can be set at same time. While the task is executing
  normally, all bits are OFF. 

      PG_CHG_EXE_C   0x00000001  KAREL calls Mnemonic or vice versa
      PG_INR_PAUS_C  0x00000002  Internal pause error occurs
      PG_INR_ABRT_C  0x00000004  Internal abort error occurs
      PG_FAIL_LK_C   0x00000008  Failed to lock the deflt mtn grp
      PG_MO_STRT_C   0x00000010  Wait for motion started
      PG_MO_DONE_C   0x00000020  Wait for motion done
      PG_UNWAIT_C    0x00000040  Wait for UNWAIT action
      PG_IO_PKT_C    0x00000080  Serial I/O request is processing
      PG_CLT_DONE_C  0x00000100  ENDCONCURRENT is processing
      PG_CAN_DONE_C  0x00000200  Stop/Cancel req is processing
      PG_PKTWT_C     0x00000400  Softparts waits for any packet
      PG_RLSDON_C    0x00000800  waits for release done message
      PG_ATCDON_C    0x00001000  waits for attach done message
      PG_AMR_STRT_C  0x00002000  Wait for AMR started
      PG_AMR_DONE_C  0x00004000  Wait for AMR done
      PG_AMR_PKT_C   0x00008000  Wait for AMR packet
      PG_UAMR_PKT_C  0x00010000  Wait for User AMR packet

